Inside the NBA studio where you can stream select games and events, including 2020 NBA All-Star and the NBA Playoffs. \nAuthenticate with your cable provider to be fully immersed into the NBA on TNT virtual world and access live games and full-game replays.\nFeatures:\n- Live VR Cast of the top match-ups\n- Choose your camera angle to experience the game from different vantage points\n- Exclusive play-by-play and analysis by NBA on TNT personalities \n- Game highlights available for free\n- Behind the scenes at 2020 NBA All-Star\n- Select games from the 2020 NBA Playoffs\nSupported Devices:\n- Samsung Gear VR Galaxy \n- Samsung S9\n- Samsung S9+\n- Samsung S8\n- Samsung S8+\n- Samsung Note8 \n- S7\n- S7+ \n- S7 edge \n- Oculus Go", "short_description": "Watch NBA on TNT games in virtual reality. Be transported to the Inside the NBA studio where you can stream select games and events, including 2020 NBA All-Star and the NBA Playoffs.\n\nAuthenticate with your cable provider to be fully immersed into the NBA on TNT virtual world and access live games and full-game replays."}]}, "developer_name": "Turner", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.nba.com/news/privacy_policy.html#/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.nba.com/news/termsofuse", "publisher_name": "Turner", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://leaguepasssupport.nba.com/", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": ["MOVIE", "MUSIC_VIDEO", "SPORTS"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GEAR_VR_CONTROLLER", "TOUCHPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"